## Description

AI in robotics gets all the attention right now, but sometimes the most interesting work is very practical.  Viet built a small vision system that counts potatoes on a conveyor belt. No giant dataset. No huge model. Just a clear problem and a smart setup.  He used Ultralytics’ https://t.co/FWBUfSq5Db

